WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The completed dashboard: entering classes, college composition and graduation rates.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Drag the distinct-student measure onto Rows.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Four entering-class bars appear.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Drag College onto Color.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The bars now show each college within the entering classes.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Select the treemap in Tableau Show Me.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The treemap shows Fall 2021 class size and four-year graduation rate by college.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Change Measure Values to Color to create the heatmap.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Compare the four- and six-year graduation rates across colleges.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Synchronize the two axes in the two-year comparison.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
The lines connect Fall 2020 and Fall 2021 four-year graduation rates.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Drag the entering-class worksheet onto the dashboard.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Align the entering-class chart.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.500
Drag the treemap onto the dashboard.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.000
Size the treemap beside the entering-class chart.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Drag the graduation-rate heatmap into the lower row.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Size the lower-left panel.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.500
Drag the two-year comparison into the lower-right panel.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.000
Align the final chart panel.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Add the governed source and refresh date to the dashboard.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Configure highlighting on selection using the College field.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Publish the workbook in Personal Space; Tableau confirms success.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
The saved dashboard shows all colleges and campus headline totals.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Select Sixth College in the treemap.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Sixth College highlights across all four charts; headline totals stay unchanged.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Return to the complete dashboard. Activity Hub graduation rates are provisional.

